LinWarrior: controls
====================

As the game's code maps them (upstream's README is older). The keyboard
and the mouse stand in for a game pad; a pad works alongside them.

  Arrow keys        throttle and steering
  J I K L           turn and tilt the turret (or move the mouse)
  R  G              fire (left mouse button fires too)
  D  A              jump jets (right mouse button too)
  E                 change the view: internal, external, far, front,
                    satellite, satellite far (middle mouse button too)
  F  S              next and previous target
  Tab               the console, on and off
  Esc               quit

Start LinWarrior from a Shell with --help for its options: --resolution,
--window, --mission, --lockmouse 0 to turn the mouse off.
